    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What can \u300aFigure Workshop\u300b do?</strong></h2><br>\u300aFigure Workshop&gt; is a virtual Figure maker,which generate by MMD model and motion.It can customize materials and expressions of figures, and there are also several interesting scenes for photography.<br><br>If you want to experience the feeling of your favorite anime character's figures filling the room, or if you want to experience the fun of figure photography, here can all fulfill your wishes.<br><br><br><strong> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > How to make </h2> </strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You need to prepare the MMD model file (PMX, PMD format) for the character you want to make, as well as an motion file (VMD format).</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>After importing the model and the  motion, \u300aFigure Workshop\u300b will pre calculate the pose of each frame and capture it, which will be displayed in the form of a slide show. You can select one from it as the figure pose. </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Add base: Customize base color, transparency, and pattern </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Custom expressions </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/024850db1d7b86bd111d7461cd638d93.poster.avif?t=1684662732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/024850db1d7b86bd111d7461cd638d93.webm?t=1684662732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/024850db1d7b86bd111d7461cd638d93.mp4?t=1684662732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Generate a figure and drag it to your cabinet </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/733e4fd2d3becd72be4f3d08241ee2e7.poster.avif?t=1684662732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/733e4fd2d3becd72be4f3d08241ee2e7.webm?t=1684662732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/733e4fd2d3becd72be4f3d08241ee2e7.mp4?t=1684662732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong> Characteristics </strong> </h2> </h2> </h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Supports model files in PMX, PMD formats, and motion data in VMD format </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Supports model files in VRM formats </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Support humanoid models (Anime characters, Ultraman, Hilichurls, etc.)</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Default anime realistic hybrid rendering system, imported models automatically adapt to texture and lighting parameters, no need to set </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> There are two scenes of school dormitories and apartments, and display slots have been set up for you to collect figures</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> emoticon modifier </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Material modifier </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Support steam workshops</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Has two location scenes: PC case and Car show </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What can \u300aFigure Workshop\u300b do?</strong></h2><br>\u300aFigure Workshop&gt; is a virtual Figure maker,which generate by MMD model and motion.It can customize materials and expressions of figures, and there are also several interesting scenes for photography.<br><br>If you want to experience the feeling of your favorite anime character's figures filling the room, or if you want to experience the fun of figure photography, here can all fulfill your wishes.<br><br><br><strong> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > How to make </h2> </strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You need to prepare the MMD model file (PMX, PMD format) for the character you want to make, as well as an motion file (VMD format).</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>After importing the model and the  motion, \u300aFigure Workshop\u300b will pre calculate the pose of each frame and capture it, which will be displayed in the form of a slide show. You can select one from it as the figure pose. </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Add base: Customize base color, transparency, and pattern </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Custom expressions </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/024850db1d7b86bd111d7461cd638d93.poster.avif?t=1684662732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/024850db1d7b86bd111d7461cd638d93.webm?t=1684662732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/024850db1d7b86bd111d7461cd638d93.mp4?t=1684662732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Generate a figure and drag it to your cabinet </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/733e4fd2d3becd72be4f3d08241ee2e7.poster.avif?t=1684662732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/733e4fd2d3becd72be4f3d08241ee2e7.webm?t=1684662732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359720/extras/733e4fd2d3becd72be4f3d08241ee2e7.mp4?t=1684662732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong> Characteristics </strong> </h2> </h2> </h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Supports model files in PMX, PMD formats, and motion data in VMD format </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Supports model files in VRM formats </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Support humanoid models (Anime characters, Ultraman, Hilichurls, etc.)</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Default anime realistic hybrid rendering system, imported models automatically adapt to texture and lighting parameters, no need to set </li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> There are two scenes of school dormitories and apartments, and display slots have been set up for you to collect figures</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> emoticon modifier </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Material modifier </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Support steam workshops</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Has two location scenes: PC case and Car show </li></ul>",
